945498_6925199470347552647_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-RiQKWZ9L24Q7kNvwFa-v4x&_nc_oc=AdqlH8Tub0UpBDmh5Wkw8-y8SZRhGdrIG9v1p-ix6jGMtldtmU4Uu0VqPxNzvW2OC-M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIF2sFWF3yE-58fBmhtzPu1G1_c7_cBkXoiBgzwF1eXxQ&oe=6A9ED61F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Logo-Wide-con-Scritta-_Personalizzato_.png", "id": "2108764886571756", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827626_2108764889905089_5789425334365975714_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VqahN4jRAvsQ7kNvwE-WPVY&_nc_oc=Ado_lzsQHcgacHo7WBWjLCSkgj9yh5fUf3A_nS6-4FUjaO1TQZa4VLeGynqi3OxRnQw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJeCZM9pK917_Dk3tckasBNkWKCcm1x2ClVtXJBbCL6mA&oe=6A9EDD2A"}, "display_name": "HoloPets", "keywords": ["Pet", "Cat", "Dog", "Simulator", "AR"], "long_description": "**HoloPets** is the ultimate Augmented Reality pet simulator that brings adorable cats and dogs to life inside your own home, with **more than 20 pets** to choose from.\n\nThanks to advanced Mixed Reality, **your virtual pets don\u2019t stay on a screen** \u2014 they roam your real room, jump on the couch, chase toys on the floor, and react to everything you do. **Each pet has unique characteristics, moods, and needs**: some are playful, others lazy, some curious and affectionate.\n\nTake care of your HoloPet every day:\n\n- **Feed them** with delicious food.\n- **Play fetch, laser pointer, ball games** and much more!\n- **Manage hunger, energy and happiness**.\n\nThe more you care for them, the stronger your bond becomes. Unlock new accessories, special behaviors and surprising evolutions!\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n- **Realistic Environmental Interaction** \u2014 pets intelligently navigate and interact with your actual surroundings.\n- **Cats & Dogs with Personality** \u2014 choose from more than 20 pets, with dozens of breeds and distinct characters.\n- **Deep Care System** \u2014 nutrition, play, rest and affection.\n- **Cloud Saves & Offline Progression** \u2014 your progress is securely saved in the cloud, and your pet\u2019s needs continue to evolve even while you\u2019re offline.\n- **Bonding & Progression** \u2014 pets grow, learn, and surprise you over time.\n\nWhether you\u2019re a cat person, a dog lover, or simply looking for a delightful virtual companion, HoloPets delivers endless joy and relaxation right in your living room.\n\nStart your holographic pet adventure today! \ud83d\udc31\ud83d\udc36", "short_description": "Adopt adorable virtual cats and dogs that come alive in your real home with HoloPets! \n\nChoose from more than 20 pets and enjoy an AR pet simulator where your holographic companions interact naturally with your environment, chasing toys across the floor, lounging on your furniture, and responding to your movements. \n\nFeed them, play with them, groom them, and build a unique bond with creatures that have their own personalities. Fun, heartwarming Mixed Reality magic awaits every pet lover!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://cyberbitgenesis.com/holopets-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://cyberbitgenesis.com/holopets-terms-of-services/", "publisher_name": "Cyberbit Genesis", "support_website_url": "https://cyberbitgenesis.com/holopets-feedback/", "website_url": "https://cyberbitgenesis.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes":